Therefore, the upper and the lower bounds \eqref{Eq:coeficient_bounds} can be calculated as:
\begin{equation}\label{Eq:finding_bounds}
\begin{aligned}
\overline{h}_{ji}(k)&=\sup\limits_{g,\tau,Z,P} h(g,\tau,Z,P,k)\\
\underline{h}_{ji}(k)&=\inf \limits_{g,\tau,Z,P}h(g,\tau,Z,P,k)\\
&\text{subject to \eqref{Eq:set_of_parameters}},
\end{aligned}
